::He is the son of the finest $(context.npc_xpbl_yngwar_playerDiction_sormirbaren) bonesmith...::

Røssar.

::Son of Jyktar, father of eight children, all sons, but only one stayed as his heir in craft, as the rest sought transcendence. But the one that stayed built with his father a suit of armor made of bone and leather for himself.::&lt;end&gt;

