::He shuts his eyes so tightly it looks as though he wants to crush them with his eyelids, then shields them with both of his arms.::

Lysbørggamen. Lysbørggamen. Fir nikke se kutt Lysbørggamen.

::They cannot kill them because of something which blinds them.::&lt;end&gt;

